General:
  UUID: "6707b2ec-c050-4f03-acf2-856f4453f018"
  Author: "BruceWorx (Heuretes FreeCAD)"
  License: "LGPL-2.1-or-later"
  Name: "Stainless 17-4PH H1150"
  Description: "Precipitation-hardening stainless (UNS S17400, EN 1.4542), aged H1150 (28-37 HRC): shafts, pins, brackets and gears machined from stock bought in this condition. Strengths are ASTM A564 minimums, 135 ksi UTS and 105 ksi yield, elongation 16 % (typical: yield 860 MPa, UTS 1000 MPa). H900 is much stronger (minimum yield 1170 MPa, UTS 1310 MPa) but brittle, with 10 % elongation."
  ReferenceSource: "ASTM A564 (Type 630, H1150) bar minimums, also AMS 5643; AK Steel 17-4 PH typical elastic and thermal values"
  SourceURL: "https://aircraftmaterials.com/data/alstst/ams5643.html"
  Tags:
    - "Heuretes FreeCAD"
    - "Metals"
